182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (Beyond scarcity, Menger identified fungibility, divisibility, portability, durability, verifiability, and low carrying cost as other important monetary attributes. Modern analyses of monetary goods have added two more: censorship resistance and established history. ETH matches or exceeds gold and Bitcoin on every one except established history.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
